okbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] dried [[Cookbook:Thyme|thyme]], crushed\n* 2 tbsp dried [[Cookbook:Parsley|parsley]], crushed\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Combine all ingredients. Keep refrigerated in an airtight container for up to 2 weeks, and remember to shake well before using.\n\n== Notes, tips, and variations ==\n\n* To use, place either 4 [[Cookbook:Each|ea]]. 6-[[Cookbook:Ounce|ounce]] wild [[Cookbook:Salmon|salmon]] filets, 4 ea. 7-ounce [[Cookbook:Mahi-mahi|mahi mahi]] filets, or 4 ea. 6-ounce [[Cookbook:Halibut|halibut]] fillets in a gallon-size zip-top bag. Pour in the marinade and refrigerate for up to 24 hours.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using wine]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon]]\n[[Category:Marinade recipes]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Seafood Marinade","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"¼ cup freshly squeezed lemon juice","sourceText":"¼ cup freshly squeezed lemon juice","amountText":"¼ cup freshly squeezed lemon juice","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"Zest of 1 lemon, finely grated","sourceText":"Zest of 1 lemon, finely grated","amountText":"Zest of 1 lemon, finely grated","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"¼ cup extra-virgin olive oil","sourceText":"¼ cup extra-virgin olive oil","amountText":"¼ cup extra-virgin olive oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 ½ tsp butter-flavored salt","sourceText":"1 ½ tsp butter-flavored salt","amountText":"1 ½ tsp butter-flavored salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 ½ tsp freshly ground black pepper","sourceText":"1 ½ tsp freshly ground black pepper","amountText":"1 ½ tsp freshly ground black pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"¼ cup dry white wine","sourceText":"¼ cup dry white wine","amountText":"¼ cup dry white wine","amount":null,"unit